                                                "sense_id": "4b9d3074-510e-3d7f-8aea-556f671cd02e",
                                                "text": "The call always starts with a whine, to which the males add from 0 to 6 chucks. In choice tests, females approach calls that contain chucks in preference to calls that contain no chucks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9c9ee9c-b200-3df9-a9de-dbed8c4a8ce2",
